{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"耶利米書","commonName":"耶利米書","title":"耶利米書","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"863aa7b1543849e3cfd2c559a4715af74ecbeb9dde4c86853162816b04e9f732","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1361},"chapter":{"number":10,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["拜偶像和真敬拜"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["以色列家啊，要聽耶和華對你們所說的話。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["耶和華如此說：",{"text":"你們不要效法列國的行為，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不要為天象驚惶，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因列國為此事驚惶。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"眾民的風俗是虛空的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們在樹林中用斧子砍伐一棵樹，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"匠人用手工造成偶像。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們用金銀妝飾它，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用釘子和錘子釘穩，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使它不動搖。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它好像棕樹，是鏇成的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不能說話，不能行走，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必須有人抬着。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們不要怕它；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它不能降禍，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也無力降福。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"耶和華啊，沒有能比你的！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你本為大，有大能大力的名。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"萬國的王啊，誰不敬畏你？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"敬畏你本是合宜的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為在列國的智慧人中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雖有政權的尊榮，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不能比你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們盡都是畜類，是愚昧的。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"偶像的訓誨算甚麼呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"偶像不過是木頭。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有銀子打成片，是從他施帶來的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並有從烏法來的金子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都是匠人和銀匠的手工，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又有藍色紫色料的衣服，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都是巧匠的工作。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"惟耶和華是真上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是活上帝，是永遠的王。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他一發怒，大地震動；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他一惱恨，列國都擔當不起。","poem":1},"（"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["你們要對他們如此說：不是那創造天地的神，必從地上從天下被除滅！）"]},{"type":"heading","content":["頌讚上帝的詩"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"耶和華用能力創造大地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用智慧建立世界，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用聰明鋪張穹蒼。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他一發聲，空中便有多水激動；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他使雲霧從地極上騰；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他造電隨雨而閃，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從他府庫中帶出風來。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"各人都成了畜類，毫無知識；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"各銀匠都因他雕刻的偶像羞愧。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他所鑄的偶像本是虛假的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"其中並無氣息，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都是虛無的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是迷惑人的工作；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"到追討的時候必被除滅。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雅各的分不像這些，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因他是造作萬有的主。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列也是他產業的支派，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"萬軍之耶和華是他的名。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["預告被擄"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"text":"受圍困的人哪，當收拾你的財物，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從國中帶出去。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為耶和華如此說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這時候，我必將此地的居民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像用機弦甩出去，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又必加害在他們身上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他們覺悟。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"text":"民說：禍哉！我受損傷；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的傷痕極其重大。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我卻說：這真是我的痛苦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必須忍受。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的帳棚毀壞；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的繩索折斷。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的兒女離我出去，沒有了。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無人再支搭我的帳棚，掛起我的幔子。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為牧人都成為畜類，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沒有求問耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以不得順利；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的羊群也都分散。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"text":"有風聲！看哪，敵人來了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有大擾亂從北方出來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要使猶大城邑變為荒涼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"成為野狗的住處。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"text":"耶和華啊，我曉得人的道路不由自己，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"行路的人也不能定自己的腳步。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華啊，求你從寬懲治我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要在你的怒中懲治我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"恐怕使我歸於無有。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"text":"願你將忿怒傾在不認識你的列國中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"和不求告你名的各族上；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們吞了雅各，不但吞了，而且滅絕，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把他的住處變為荒場。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/10.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/11.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/9.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":25}